# Introduction

Artificial intelligence (AI) can assist with manuscript preparation.
Academic papers are easier to maintain when source text, references,
figures, tables, and rendered outputs are kept separate. Pandoc provides
a practical bridge from plain-text manuscript sources to Word documents
used by coauthors and journals [@macfarlane2026pandoc].

This template keeps that workflow intentionally small. The manuscript is
split into ordered Markdown files, generated artifacts are produced by
scripts, and `scripts/trazo verify` checks that the complete
paper-generation path still works.

